---
source: src/scope.rs
expression: "outline(\"with p as (select 1 as n), q as (select * from p) select * from q, (with r as (select 2) select * from r) s; \\\n             select * from p\")"
---
select from [] ctes [p, q]
select from [p] ctes [p, q]
select from [q, (subquery)] ctes [p, q]
  select from [] ctes [p, q, r]
  select from [r] ctes [p, q, r]
select from [p] ctes []
